  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTPS: fix redundant parameterData for vendor-specific PIDs",
  "description": "The parameter dissection loop tried v1 and v2 dissectors, and if both\nreturned false it emitted raw parameterData bytes before running the\nvendor-specific dissector. This caused PIDs handled only by a vendor\ndissector (e.g. PID_RTI_DOMAIN_ID 0x800f) to display both the decoded\nfield and a redundant parameterData hex line.\n\nRestructure the flow to accumulate a 'handled' flag across all\ndissectors (v1, v2, and the active vendor dissector) and defer the\nraw-bytes fallback until after all dissectors have run. Unrecognized\nPIDs still display their raw bytes as before.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
